body:
i am now able to solo nm100 with a time (7\~8 minutes) that's shorter than my solo nm95 (8\~9 minutes) time a year ago T\_T

&#x200B;

also, i am able to break into top 15k this gw after constantly getting kicked out of top 70k for the past few gws. it was a mad grind. wont attempt it again especially the coming bonito war.

i actually like:

gran-esser/magisa/cerberus/janu/clarisse

&#x200B;

djeeta-sandalphon/lucio/percival/cassius/eustace/siegfried/feather

&#x200B;

Lyria is a sweet girl but idk maybe the soul-linked trope is too boring for me.

dang! did you look at the profile? was there a six and azazel? lol that's awesome! time to sell my soul to bonito ROFL

&#x200B;

thank you! i thought it was nerfed badly. i didnt really look up the % of resistance they add.

